             "how its sections were put together): Start Game, then the band's intro, the title and its flyovers, the file select",
             "and a new game (keys held 300 ms; Start is Enter, A Space; Start pressed five times reaches the file select whenever",
             "the intro is skipped). Then ttc, fp, mmm, grunty and ending, each a load that starts a new game as game does, skips",
             "its opening to Spiral Mountain and warps on from there by tools/warp.js, what those draw left out: in each place",
             "about 25 s of walking out and back, jumps, attacks, eggs (Z with C-down), Z with B and the camera turned (Z is Q, B",
             "Shift, the C buttons the arrow keys), and the ending's cutscene maps watched from the battlements on."],
